{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y压缩了少数叙事中的心理岔路，例如X里“早知道这样，自己还会走吗”和“要是没走，如今会怎样”的反事实追问，人物犹疑的层次略有减少。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句通过加亮直接浮出来，话与音乐感受交替出现，普通观众不必费力在两列信息之间寻找叙事主线；感受描述又有具体的声音、身体反应、空间和情绪变化，并且不少内容随乐段到时出现，能形成边听边认出的体验。尤其从怀念、短暂安慰、再次惊醒、反复动摇到逐渐站稳，Y的音乐变化和人物心理推进结合得更紧。X的叙事解释略有优势，保留了更多反事实思考和心理转折，但右侧感受有些像同时摆开的情绪清单，观众需要自己整理它们之间的关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2174c031-ac67-4609-8ff2-4c46393c42b3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T062738207584Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T06:28:41.875689+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "90156ff1597deb0ea0730cc8b6965e775471b973987382d6f85527f970884505", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc422230